layout: feature
footer: This season's roast
---
:: kick ::
Seasonal feature — limited batch
:: head ::
A real, hand-roasted deck, matched cup-for-cup.
:: body ::
We poured it blind against a barista's hand-built original. Side by side, you couldn't taste the difference — the crema held, the color held, nothing drifted.
:: stat ::
