---
layout: cards
footer: One bean, every cup
---
:: head ::
One source. Every cup. No house blend you can't leave.
:: c1 ::
**Pour it three ways** >>>

A web cup, a high-fidelity print, an editable PowerPoint — same bean, no drift between them.
:: c2 ::
**Bring your own beans** >>>

We *import* your old PowerPoint and Keynote, and *export* editable .pptx right back out. No lock-in.
:: c3 ::
**The roaster never sleeps** >>>

An MCP server lets your agents grind, taste, and serve the whole deck end to end.
